    {
      "bbox": [
        194,
        1541,
        1955,
        1687
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "On July 31st, the Mayor issued an Executive Memorandum concerning the implementation of a voluntary payroll deduction plan for the United Fund of Greater New York.",
